# Parameters layered on ArduPilot's quadplane defaults for every recorded flight.
# Pass with: sim_vehicle.py ... -w --add-param-file=<repo>/sitl/sitl.parm
#
# Battery monitor. quadplane.parm leaves it off (type NONE), so SYS_STATUS reports
# battery_remaining = -1 and voltage 0 for the whole flight (found on the first flight,
# 2026-10-25). Type 4 = analog voltage and current: SITL simulates the current drawn by
# the motors and ArduPilot counts the mAh used against BATT_CAPACITY.
BATT_MONITOR    4
# ArduPilot's default capacity, written out so the number behind battery_remaining is in the repo.
BATT_CAPACITY   3300
